@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Verdana
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam roundCorner 6
skinparam ArrowColor #4A5568
skinparam TitleFontSize 16
skinparam TitleFontColor #1A202C
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #D6BF7A
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title Ayshaa-RAG - Entites du domaine

hide empty methods
skinparam linetype ortho

note as N
  Service Python : les structures de donnees sont des modeles
  Pydantic, pas des entites persistees par un ORM.
end note

class "ChatRequest" as ChatRequest <<Pydantic>>
class "Source" as Source <<Pydantic>>
class "ChatResponse" as ChatResponse <<Pydantic>>
class "GreetingResponse" as GreetingResponse <<Pydantic>>
class "HealthResponse" as HealthResponse <<Pydantic>>
class "ReindexResponse" as ReindexResponse <<Pydantic>>

legend right
6 modeles Pydantic releves dans AyshaaRAG.
Aucune persistance relationnelle propre a ce service.
endlegend

@enduml
